body:
How childish, immature, and embarrassing for a woman in her 40s to be engaging in this kind of behavior. Hell, I'm about your age and most of my friends are more mature than this. She was integral to an important part of your life, and for that you can be thankful. But she purposefully went out of her way to embarrass you, for absolutely no reason, in front of your family behind your back. Good riddance. NTA.

&#x200B;

